# Held awake with the lid shut and forgotten in a bag. Heat is the danger in there:
# the case heats with nowhere for it to go, at critical temperature awake gives up
# the lid, forced or not, and the Mac sleeps and cools. And if the bag stays cool,
# the battery floor ends it with charge to spare.
clock 22:10 · battery 41 · floor 15 · cpu 52 · gpu 46 · ssd 38 · skin 31 · fans 0 · awake on
view skin

# Into the bag: the lid folds while the time-lapse runs and the heat climbs. The
# `@0` makes it the story's first act, not part of the opening frame.
@0 lid close · time +25m · cpu 99 · gpu 90 · ssd 54 · skin 46 · fans 35
thermal critical
time +20m · cpu 41 · gpu 39 · ssd 42 · skin 32 · fans 0
# Each story ends where the person meets it: the lid opens on awake's banner.
lid open
caption "If it gets too hot, awake lets it sleep to cool off."
thermal nominal
key
lid close
time +3h05m · battery 15
lid open
caption "If the battery runs low, it sleeps too."
